 {
  "log": "--- The language badge (M8c), with real clicks: a click on it pops the menu up (closed through its own API), a choice rewrites the info string and undoes, the menu's keys, clicks beside and under it place the caret, it steps aside for the caret, in Live mode and in Split after divider drags"
 },
 {
  "viewMode": "source"
 },
 {
  "layout": "editor"
 },
 {
  "load": "# Code\n\nProse before the block.\n\n```rust,ignore,edition2021,no_run,should_panic,a_deliberately_long_info_string_that_runs_under_the_badge\nlet second = \"line\";\nfn third() { let x = 1; }\n```\n\nProse between.\n\n```python\nx = 1  # c\n```\n\nThe end.\n"
 },
 {
  "select": [
   0,
   0
  ]
 },
 {
  "waitStyled": 30
 },
 {
  "assert": {
   "code": {
    "badges": [
     "Rust",
     "Python"
    ],
    "badgeAtTopRightOf": "let second"
   }
  }
 },
 {
  "codeBadge": {
   "click": "let second",
   "real": true
  }
 },
 {
  "assert": {
   "selection": [
    0,
    0
   ],
   "code": {
    "codeMenu": {
     "first": "Rust",
     "checked": "Rust",
     "commonCount": 31,
     "last": "All"
    }
   }
  }
 },
 {
  "codeBadge": {
   "click": "let second",
   "real": true,
   "choose": "Python"
  }
 },
 {
  "waitStyled": 30
 },
 {
  "assert": {
   "textContains": "```python,ignore,edition2021",
   "coreMatchesText": true,
   "code": {
    "badges": [
     "Python",
     "Python"
    ],
    "codeColours": [
     {
      "needle": "let second",
      "role": "code"
     }
    ]
   }
  }
 },
 {
  "undo": true
 },
 {
  "waitStyled": 30
 },
 {
  "assert": {
   "textContains": "```rust,ignore,edition2021",
   "code": {
    "badges": [
     "Rust",
     "Python"
    ],
    "codeColours": [
     {
      "needle": "let second",
      "role": "keyword"
     }
    ]
   }
  }
 },
 {
  "log": "--- the menu's keyboard: Down highlights the first item, Return chooses it; Escape closes it"
 },
 {
  "codeBadge": {
   "click": "x = 1  # c",
   "real": true,
   "keys": [
    "down",
    "down",
    "up",
    "return"
   ],
   "expectHighlighted": [
    "Rust",
    "Python",
    "Rust"
   ]
  }
 },
 {
  "waitStyled": 30
 },
 {
  "assert": {
   "textContains": "```rust\nx = 1",
   "code": {
    "badges": [
     "Rust",
     "Rust"
    ]
   }
  }
 },
 {
  "undoUntilContains": "```python\nx = 1"
 },
 {
  "waitStyled": 30
 },
 {
  "codeBadge": {
   "click": "x = 1  # c",
   "real": true,
   "keys": [
    "escape"
   ]
  }
 },
 {
  "assert": {
   "textContains": "```python\nx = 1"
  }
 },
